62
00:03:01.832 --> 00:03:04.520
Your turn. Say: Notification.

63
00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:08.395
Notification.

64
00:03:09.383 --> 00:03:11.360
Now let's listen to a conversation.

65
00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:14.286
Sreypich, how do you use technology for school?

66
00:03:15.583 --> 00:03:17.629
I use a tablet and a learning app.

67
00:03:18.917 --> 00:03:20.997
Do you share your password with friends?

68
00:03:22.283 --> 00:03:24.831
No! You shouldn't share your password.

69
00:03:26.117 --> 00:03:28.583
Good. What should you do with updates?

70
00:03:29.883 --> 00:03:32.443
You should install them. They keep the app safe.

71
00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:36.249
Grammar focus: should and shouldn't.

72
00:03:36.549 --> 00:03:39.991
You should keep your password secret. You shouldn't share it.

73
00:03:40.291 --> 00:03:43.219
Use 'should' for good advice and 'shouldn't' for bad ideas.

74
00:03:44.217 --> 00:03:47.136
Now read and listen. My Digital Classroom.

75
00:03:47.436 --> 00:03:49.761
I use a tablet to study with apps.

76
00:03:51.050 --> 00:03:54.721
Every morning, I check my notifications from the class app.

77
00:03:56.017 --> 00:03:58.306
I upload my homework to the school website.

78
00:03:59.617 --> 00:04:03.253
I always keep my password secret and visit safe websites.

79
00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:07.118
When I finish, I put my tablet on the charger.

80
00:04:08.417 --> 00:04:11.092
Quiz time! Choose the correct answer.

81
00:04:11.392 --> 00:04:13.136
You blank share your password.

82
00:04:13.436 --> 00:04:16.997
A, shouldn't. B, should. C, must to.

83
00:04:20.983 --> 00:04:23.099
The answer is A: shouldn't.

84
00:04:24.583 --> 00:04:27.488
A secret word that opens your account is a blank.

85
00:04:27.788 --> 00:04:31.976
A, password. B, monitor. C, charger.

86
00:04:35.983 --> 00:04:38.331
The answer is A: password.

87
00:04:39.817 --> 00:04:42.490
To send a file to the internet is to blank.

88
00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:46.443
A, upload. B, update. C, type.

89
00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:52.508
The answer is A: upload.

90
00:04:54.017 --> 00:04:57.784
Now it's your turn to speak. What app or website helps you learn?

91
00:05:03.084 --> 00:05:09.370
A dictionary app helps me learn new words. I use it every day, and I always keep my password secret.

92
00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:11.855
Excellent answer, Sreypich!

93
00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:16.849
Great work today! You learned twelve new words and should and shouldn't.

94
00:05:17.149 --> 00:05:21.972
Today's value is online safety. Keep your password secret and be kind online.

95
00:05:22.272 --> 00:05:24.565
See you in Unit two. Goodbye!

96
00:05:24.865 --> 00:05:27.239
Thank you, Mr. Jake! Bye, everyone!

